{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1460172-essence-multi-exalt-type-teams","id":1460172,"title":"[Essence] Multi-Exalt type teams.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-09-16T20:24:07-07:00","id":1460172,"title":"[Essence] Multi-Exalt type teams.","content":"So I ran Exalted in the early days of 2e and now I'm thinking of making a return with Essence. So my knowledge of any exalts other than Solars and Dragon Blooded is pretty surface level. Since Essence makes having multiple Exalt types together in the same circle a much easier possibility, which ones would work best together from a setting and fluff perspective? Which ones work well together from a mechanics perspective? Which exalt types should stay far away from each other.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12488-jeremysbrain","name":"Jeremysbrain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-16T21:29:32-07:00","id":1460176,"title":"","content":"From a purely fluff perspective, DBs are mostly gonna work with themselves and occasionally Sids and exigents.<br /> <br /> Sids will probably work with DBs and anything that fits their needs though I imagine Abyssals, and Infernals if they're listed, are probably on the list of things to not work with or at least be very careful if one must. The Get and Lunars are pretty much no goes as its very likely either of those factions will decide to kill a Sid when they encounter one, so the Sids will probably try first and that's just gonna sour any prospective team ups.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https